	(text "TPS55288 at I2C 0x75 on the port channel (MODE open: external VCC, PFM). OE defaults off; EN low resets the registers.\nFSW 47k: 425 kHz. ILIM 47k: 7.0 A average inductor limit. Output limit via 10 mOhm sense, up to 6.35 A by register.\nOutput switch: LM74502 with back-to-back FETs; OV trips at 6.6 V, or 23 V with OV_HIGH set (default off).\nHub population: entire sheet DNP."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 248.92 0)
		(effects
